[
  {
    "id": "chapter1_1",
    "bg": null,
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "A shiver runs through me.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/eyes.mp3",
    "eyesEffect": true,
    "next": "chapter1_2"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_2",
    "bg": null,
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "That feeling again.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/eyes.mp3",
    "eyesEffect": true,
    "next": "chapter1_3"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_3",
    "bg": null,
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "As if someone were watching me.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/eyes.mp3",
    "eyesEffect": true,
    "next": "chapter1_4"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_4",
    "bg": null,
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Even when I sleep, I can't seem to shake it.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/eyes.mp3",
    "eyesEffect": true,
    "next": "chapter1_5"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_5",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Sunlight streams through the large windows of the school, spilling across the hallway. ",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_6"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_6",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I walk quickly toward my locker, glancing around every now and then without really knowing why.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_7"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_7",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I notice a piece of paper sticking out of my locker. I slow down.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_8"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_8",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I don't remember leaving anything here.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_9"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_9",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I gently pull the paper out.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_10"
  },
   {
    "id": "chapter1_10",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "overlayImg": "images/objects/confession.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_11"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_11",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "No signature.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_12"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_12",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I read the few lines again, not really sure what to make of them.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_13"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_13",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Who could have left this?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_14"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_14",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "And more importantly… should I really go to this meeting?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_15"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_15",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I could simply not go. What if it's just a prank?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_16"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_16",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Hi!",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_17"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_17",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumscared.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Haaa!",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_18"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_18",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumscared.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I jump and quickly turn around.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_19"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_19",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "A girl is standing behind me.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_20"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_20",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Her long lavender hair falls on either side of her face, with a few strands framing her eyes. She looks just as surprised as I am.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_21"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_21",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Uh… sorry!",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_22"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_22",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumreallyscared.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She raises her hands slightly, as if to defend herself.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_23"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_23",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "I didn't mean to scare you…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_24"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_24",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumscared.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "It's nothing. I was just distracted.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_25"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_25",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I discreetly slip the paper into my notebook before looking at her.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_26"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_26",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Did you need something?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_27"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_27",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Well… I'm one of your readers from the magazine club. I particularly liked the article where you wrote about…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_28"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_28",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She hesitates for a moment, as if trying to find the right words.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_29"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_29",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "I mean… I really liked it.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_30"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_30",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Oh, thank you.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_31"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_31",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg":"images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I smile at her.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_32"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_32",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "That really means a lot. Writing for this club… it's the one place where I feel like I can share what I love with others.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_33"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_33",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She lowers her eyes slightly, fidgeting with her fingers.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_34"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_34",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Um… hmm…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_35"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_35",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She finally looks back up at me.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_36"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_36",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Could we be friends?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_37"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_37",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Of course.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_38"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_38",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I tilt my head slightly.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_39"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_39",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "What's your name?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_40"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_40",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "My name…?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_41"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_41",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Plu… Plum.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_42"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_42",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Nice to meet you, Plum. I'm Étoile.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_43"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_43",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg":"images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I casually tuck my notebook against myself before continuing on my way.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_44"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_44",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "I'm actually heading to the club right now. If you want, you can come with me. I could show you around.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_45"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_45",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Plum blinks, as if she wasn't expecting that.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_46"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_46",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Really?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_47"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_47",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She tucks a strand of hair behind her ear and quickly looks down.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_48"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_48",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "You don't mind?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_49"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_49",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Not at all. My friends will be happy to meet you. It's been a while since we've had someone new at the club.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_50"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_50",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Okay…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_51"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_51",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She timidly looks back up at me.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_52"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_52",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "I'd like that.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_53"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_53",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "A barely noticeable smile escapes her before she looks away again.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_54"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_54",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "We continue walking side by side.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_55"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_55",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "After a few steps, her shoulder almost brushes against mine. She doesn't move away.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_56"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_56",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg":  "images/characters/rosehappytalk.png",
    "speaker": "Rose",
    "text": "Oh, look who's here. A new face?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_57"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_57",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg":   "images/characters/miratalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Mira",
    "text": "You're late, Étoile. I hope you have a good excuse. We're already behind on the project.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_58"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_58",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg":  "images/characters/rosetalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Rose",
    "text": "Oh, stop. You're going to scare her.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_59"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_59",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg":  "images/characters/miratalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Mira",
    "text": "I'm not scaring her. I'm just saying—",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_60"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_60",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/rosehappytalk.png",
    "speaker": "Rose",
    "text": "A new member?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_61"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_61",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/miraneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Mira slowly turns her head toward Rose.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_62"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_62",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/miratalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Mira",
    "text": "What do you mean, \"new member\"?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_63"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_63",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/rosesmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Rose shrugs slightly.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_64"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_64",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/miratalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Mira",
    "text": "You can't just decide that on your own. There are procedures for—",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_65"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_65",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg":"images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
   "text": "She's just here to look around. She's a loyal reader.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_66"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_66",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Hello…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_67"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_67",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/rosehappytalk.png",
    "speaker": "Rose",
    "text": "Nice to meet you! I'm Rose.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_68"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_68",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/rosesmile.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Rose smiles at Plum.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/club.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_69"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_69",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/club_room.webp",
